            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Production of a ventilation unit (air handling unit) with 3500 m3/h nominal air flow rate (at 2 m/s air speed in cross section of air filter or heat exchanger), component weight: 1125 kg, total weight: 1324 kg/Unit, including average components for controls, inverter and electric control cabinet, material for 20 filter replacements (once a year for 20 years lifetime). The air handling unit includes a frame construction, two radial belt drive fans, two multi-leaf damper, heat recovery with aluminium rotary heat exchanger (thermal wheel), heating elements, expansion plenum and empty section in supply and extract air. No cooling elements, humidifier, air-mixing plenum and silencer included. The frame construction made of aluminium-profiles, casing made of hot-dip galvanized and powder coated steel sheets insulated with polyurethane foam.;
UUID: 5eec064d-3338-3c7c-8b88-ca3ec638f60d</common:generalComment>
